    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：Define momentum as Mom6m, and volume as the rolling average of the past 6 months of monthly turnover (minimum 5 months). Independent sort stocks into 10 momentum ports and 3 volume ports. Keep if volume is in the top port, and assign signal = momentum port. Drop if less than 2 years on CRSP. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=0.2；PortfolioPeriod=3.0个月；StartMonth=6.0；Sign=1.0；TestInOP=port sort。股票池/过滤：abs(prc)>1, exchcd %in% c(1,2)。 Notes：We use monthly instead of daily volume.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
    },
